ociates;","85":"Let him summon his comrades;","22":"Then, let him call (for help) to his council (of comrades):","203":"Then let him call upon his council (of helpers)."},"words":[{"id":19699,"position":1,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"فَلْيَدْعُ","translation":{"text":"Then let him call","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"falyadʿu","language_name":"english"}},{"id":19700,"position":2,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"نَادِيَهُۥ","translation":{"text":"his associates","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"nādiyahu","language_name":"english"}}]},{"id":6124,"verse_number":18,"verse_key":"96:18","juz_number":30,"rub_el_hizb_number":239,"hizb_number":60,"ruku_number":540,"manzil_number":7,"sajdah_number":null,"page_number":598,"text_uthmani":"سَنَدْعُ ٱلزَّبَانِيَةَ","trs":{"20":"We will call the angels of Hell.<sup foot_note=197787>1</sup>","85":"We shall summon the guards of Hell.","22":"We will call on the angels of punishment (to deal with him)!","203":"We will call out the guards of Hell (to deal with him)!"},"words":[{"id":20790,"position":1,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"سَنَدْعُ","translation":{"text":"We will call","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"sanadʿu","language_name":"english"}},{"id":20791,"position":2,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلزَّبَانِيَةَ","translation":{"text":"the Angels of Hell","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"l-zabāniyata","language_name":"english"}}]},{"id":6125,"verse_number":19,"verse_key":"96:19","juz_number":30,"rub_el_hizb_number":239,"hizb_number":60,"ruku_number":540,"manzil_number":7,"sajdah_number":14,"page_number":598,"text_uthmani":"كَلَّا لَا تُطِعْهُ وَٱسْجُدْ وَٱقْتَرِب ۩","trs":{"20":"No! Do not obey him. But prostrate and draw near [to Allāh].","85":"No! Do not obey him [Prophet]: bow down in worship and draw close.","22":"Nay, heed him not: But bow down in adoration, and bring thyself the closer (to Allah)!","203":"